{
  "_README": [
    "What A01 scrapes. Edit this file to change the engine's field of view \u2014",
    "no code change needed. Missing keys fall back to the defaults in",
    "pipeline/intelligence_stream/source_config.py.",
    "",
    "Why this exists: the source list used to be hardcoded in a class body,",
    "and two of its four doc sources were Blend and Stellar. A narrow input",
    "pool cannot produce varied output, however good the agents downstream",
    "are \u2014 32 of 41 runs landed on the same Blend v2 topic.",
    "",
    "news_queries is a LIST and a different subset is used each cycle. One",
    "fixed query ('stellar soroban defi') returned near-identical headlines",
    "every run, which was the single largest cause of the repetition."
  ],
